# Files the repair tool must not touch.
#
# A file listed here is skipped because the repository's own gates already fail
# on it. Trunk Check lints the files a change touches and reports their
# EXISTING findings as new ones, so rewriting a file that already fails its
# type check turns that pre-existing failure into a new one and blocks the
# gate. Those files need their own cleanup, not a path rewrite bolted onto it.
#
# Both entries are mypy failures that predate this work:
#   scripts/e2e_real_model.py            mypy/name-defined: "mx" is not defined
#   gui/admin-extensions/api/research_panel.py   mypy failures (2)
#
# scripts/phenotype_omlx_ready.py is excluded for a different reason: ruff
# reports unused imports there (F401), which the gate attributes to any change
# that touches the file.
scripts/e2e_real_model.py
gui/admin-extensions/api/research_panel.py
scripts/phenotype_omlx_ready.py
